{"created": "2024-05-24T06:56:31.592881+00:00", "modified": "2024-05-24T07:08:43.915219+00:00", "id": 11275211, "conceptrecid": "4742142", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.11275211", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.4742142", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11275211", "metadata": {"title": "India Flood Inventory-Impacts (IFI-Impacts) [1967-2023]: A multi-source national geospatial database to facilitate comprehensive flood research", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.11275211", "publication_date": "2024-05-24", "description": "<p>This repository hosts the India Flood Inventory with Impacts (IFI-Impacts) database. It contains flood event data sourced from the Indian Meteorological Department from 1967-2023. It has undergone extensive manual digitization, cleaning, and includes new information to make it suitable for computational research in hydroclimate.</p>\n<p>v1.0: India Flood Inventory (IFI) 1967-2016.</p>\n<p>v2.0: India Flood Inventory (IFI) 1967-2023. With impacts and district flooded area.</p>\n<p>v3.0: India Flood Inventory (IFI) 1967-2023. Updated with local government codes (LGD) for state and district.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>IFI v1.0 publication: Saharia, M., Jain, A., Baishya, R.R., Haobam, S., Sreejith, O.P., Pai, D.S., Rafieeinasab, A., 2021. India flood inventory: creation of a multi-source national geospatial database to facilitate comprehensive flood research. Nat Hazards. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11069-021-04698-6\">https://doi.org/10.1007/s11069-021-04698-6</a></p>\n<p>IFI v2.0 publication: Saharia, Manabendra, et al. <em>A District Level Flood Severity Index for India</em>. arXiv:2405.01602, arXiv, 1 May 2024. <em>arXiv.org</em>, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2405.01602\">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2405.01602</a>. [Under Review]</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Manabendra Saharia", "affiliation": "IIT Delhi"}], "keywords": ["India", "floods"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1007/s11069-021-04698-6", "relation":